              "text": "Able? (कुशलः, kuśalaḥ.) Expert? (निपुणः, nipuṇaḥ.) Ignorant? (अज्ञः, ajñaḥ.) Wise? (विज्ञः, vijñaḥ.) Intelligent? (बुद्धिमान्, buddhimān.) Red? (रक्तः, raktaḥ.) Reddish? (अरुणः, aruṇaḥ.) Tawny? (कपिलः, kapilaḥ.) Equal? (समः, samaḥ.) Uneven? (विषमः, viṣamaḥ.) A broom? (सम्मार्जनी, sammārjanī.) An axe? (कुठारः, kuṭhāraḥ.) A spade? (खनित्रम्, khanitram.) A plough? (हलम्, halam.) A sickle? (दात्रम्, dātram.) A bael fruit? (बिल्वम्, bilvam.) An orange? (नारंगम्, nāraṅgam.) A wood apple? (कपित्थः, kapitthaḥ.) An apple? (सेवफलम्, sevaphalam.) Flattened rice? (चिपिटकः, cipiṭakaḥ.) A balance? (तुला, tulā.) A measuring rod? (मानदण्डः, mānadaṇḍaḥ.) A stick? (दण्डः, daṇḍaḥ.) A staff? (यष्टिः, yaṣṭiḥ.) An archer's bow? (धनुः, dhanuḥ.)"
